1
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,110
Wen Xin told me

2
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:12,350
that you and my mother
were old acquaintances.

3
00:00:12,350 --> 00:00:13,270
Wen Yan.

4
00:00:13,390 --> 00:00:15,380
We've known each other for many years.

5
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:16,390
Seeing

6
00:00:16,510 --> 00:00:18,510
how tragically she died on the news,

7
00:00:18,830 --> 00:00:20,350
it really broke my heart.

8
00:00:20,510 --> 00:00:22,800
She was such a
decisive and capable person,

9
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:24,930
yet was framed by that animal Chen Hui.

10
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:27,310
And then she was locked away
in that dark place

11
00:00:27,310 --> 00:00:28,520
for so many years.

12
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:30,300
If she were still here,

13
00:00:30,550 --> 00:00:33,550
Wen Group would never
have fallen to where it is today.

14
00:00:33,990 --> 00:00:35,310
So I'm here to help you

15
00:00:35,710 --> 00:00:37,370
to comfort her soul in heaven.

16
00:00:38,990 --> 00:00:41,030
Thank you for your help.

17
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:44,200
It's just that

18
00:00:44,710 --> 00:00:47,520
your offer is way too low.

19
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:48,960
Ms. Wen,

20
00:00:49,240 --> 00:00:50,570
you are still too young.

21
00:00:51,430 --> 00:00:53,920
I'm already being generous

22
00:00:53,940 --> 00:00:55,940
with this price.

23
00:00:56,170 --> 00:00:59,450
We both know that

24
00:00:59,570 --> 00:01:01,500
you've talked to other investors.

25
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:03,630
Yet we are here together today,

26
00:01:04,140 --> 00:01:05,340
which signifies that

27
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:07,230
I am

28
00:01:08,760 --> 00:01:10,510
your optimal choice.

29
00:01:18,230 --> 00:01:19,200
Alright.

30
00:01:41,610 --> 00:01:42,640
Don't worry, Ms. Wen.

31
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:44,440
Now that the group is in my hands,

32
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:46,330
I will definitely make it thrive.

33
00:01:49,670 --> 00:01:51,880
I hope you can keep your promise

34
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:53,729
and inject the funds to save it.

35
00:01:54,060 --> 00:01:56,780
It really needs this money right now.

36
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:58,170
Money is not a problem.

37
00:01:58,280 --> 00:01:59,280
I'll transfer two billion

38
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:01,350
as bridge funds to you right away

39
00:02:01,510 --> 00:02:03,440
to relieve your urgent situation.

40
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:13,610
Uncle Long,

41
00:02:14,580 --> 00:02:16,180
the money didn't go through.

42
00:02:16,670 --> 00:02:17,440
What?

43
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:19,230
What do you mean?

44
00:02:19,250 --> 00:02:21,690
I transferred the money as you instructed,

45
00:02:21,820 --> 00:02:23,070
but the system shows

46
00:02:23,090 --> 00:02:25,680
the funds disappeared
at the intermediary bank.

47
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:26,400
And...

48
00:02:26,590 --> 00:02:28,120
the final destination marker

49
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:30,250
points to an anonymous Swiss account.

50
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:33,020
The associated information of
that account...

51
00:02:33,430 --> 00:02:34,960
Tell me, who does it point to?

52
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:35,590
Tell me!

53
00:02:37,890 --> 00:02:39,820
[Dearest: Episode 23]

54
00:02:38,470 --> 00:02:39,260
Uncle Long,

55
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:40,329
long time no see.

56
00:02:41,270 --> 00:02:43,990
I'll gladly accept your two billion.

57
00:02:44,770 --> 00:02:47,890
Consider it my fee for working for you,

58
00:02:47,920 --> 00:02:50,720
and my startup capital for
returning to Wen Group.

59
00:02:52,370 --> 00:02:53,130
He Mu,

60
00:02:54,100 --> 00:02:55,230
how dare you play me!

61
00:02:56,140 --> 00:02:57,140
Uncle Long,

62
00:02:57,160 --> 00:02:59,000
don't be so harsh.

63
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:02,030
The group belongs to me originally.

64
00:03:02,230 --> 00:03:04,980
You were just
temporarily keeping the funds for me.

65
00:03:04,980 --> 00:03:06,260
Besides, without me,

66
00:03:06,610 --> 00:03:08,050
your life after you got out

67
00:03:08,050 --> 00:03:10,710
wouldn't be nearly
as good as it is now, would it?

68
00:03:11,710 --> 00:03:12,560
After all,

69
00:03:12,860 --> 00:03:15,390
without me, there'd be no you
as you are today,

70
00:03:15,450 --> 00:03:16,770
so you should thank me.

71
00:03:19,180 --> 00:03:19,780
By the way,

72
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:22,190
I've decided to

73
00:03:22,270 --> 00:03:23,640
change the plan.

74
00:03:24,750 --> 00:03:28,410
Keeping it all for myself is
way better than splitting it with you.

75
00:03:28,670 --> 00:03:30,079
Oh, and thank you for helping me handle

76
00:03:30,079 --> 00:03:31,829
that silly girl Wen Jianan,

77
00:03:31,850 --> 00:03:34,310
and getting her
to sign this document for me.

78
00:03:35,150 --> 00:03:36,990
It saved me a lot of trouble.

79
00:03:37,570 --> 00:03:38,570
He Mu,

80
00:03:39,850 --> 00:03:42,180
so you and Uncle Long
are in this together.

81
00:03:42,320 --> 00:03:44,480
You two joined forces to deceive me.

82
00:03:45,430 --> 00:03:46,750
My dear daughter,

83
00:03:47,030 --> 00:03:49,030
it's too late to realize that now.

84
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:50,360
The group

85
00:03:50,750 --> 00:03:54,030
should return to its real owner.

86
00:03:55,030 --> 00:03:55,750
Uncle Long,

87
00:03:56,230 --> 00:03:58,720
no need to thank me for this gift.

88
00:03:58,950 --> 00:03:59,670
Bye-bye.

89
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:06,160
The plan is a success.

90
00:04:08,470 --> 00:04:10,470
I'll tear you to pieces!

91
00:04:12,190 --> 00:04:12,910
Everyone,

92
00:04:12,930 --> 00:04:13,760
search everywhere

93
00:04:13,760 --> 00:04:15,490
to find that little brat for me.

94
00:04:15,930 --> 00:04:17,200
I want him alive.

95
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:41,460
Look at today's high tech,

96
00:04:41,490 --> 00:04:43,200
AI can swap faces in real time,

97
00:04:43,220 --> 00:04:44,070
perfectly.

98
00:04:44,220 --> 00:04:46,700
Even an old fox like
Uncle Long was deceived.

99
00:04:47,630 --> 00:04:48,750
It's mainly because Yin Mingzhu

100
00:04:48,750 --> 00:04:50,950
intercepted and froze his dirty money.

101
00:04:51,300 --> 00:04:52,620
Two billion.

102
00:04:52,950 --> 00:04:55,690
He was in no mood to care
if the video was real or fake.

103
00:04:55,690 --> 00:04:57,490
The two billion ghost transfer,

104
00:04:57,659 --> 00:04:59,650
the perfect frame-up on
He Mu's overseas account,

105
00:04:59,650 --> 00:05:02,710
plus that perfectly timed
provocative video from him,

106
00:05:03,070 --> 00:05:04,070
Uncle Long is now

107
00:05:04,070 --> 00:05:06,400
so furious that
he wants to tear him apart.

108
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:13,430
What? The acquisition failed?

109
00:05:17,080 --> 00:05:18,940
It must be Wen Jianan behind this.

110
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:21,400
She must have found out
something about me.

111
00:05:21,640 --> 00:05:22,640
The plan failed.

112
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:24,920
Since his money has been wasted,

113
00:05:25,430 --> 00:05:27,030
he definitely won't let me off.

114
00:05:27,030 --> 00:05:28,780
Daddy, we must flee.

115
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:34,600
Uncle Long is here.

116
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:36,560
He Mu,

117
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:39,070
you ungrateful thing!

118
00:05:39,490 --> 00:05:41,290
I've been loyal to you.

119
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:44,950
Now you're just leaving me here to die?

120
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:49,159
He Mu, what do you expect me to do now?

121
00:05:49,850 --> 00:05:50,510
Where is he?

122
00:05:50,520 --> 00:05:51,200
Uncle Long,

123
00:05:51,500 --> 00:05:53,060
I... I don't know.

124
00:05:53,750 --> 00:05:54,880
I really don't know.

125
00:06:01,950 --> 00:06:02,680
Go after him!

126
00:06:08,870 --> 00:06:10,470
Uncle Long, I... I really...

127
00:06:12,430 --> 00:06:13,560
Let me tell you.

128
00:06:13,750 --> 00:06:17,000
If you can't catch him, I'll ruin you.

129
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:19,000
Uncle Long,

130
00:06:19,070 --> 00:06:19,830
I don't know anything.

131
00:06:19,830 --> 00:06:20,790
I don't know anything.

132
00:06:20,790 --> 00:06:22,990
I... I don't know anything, Uncle Long.

133
00:06:24,490 --> 00:06:26,220
There's news from Yin Mingzhu.

134
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:27,560
She and the police

135
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:29,870
raided the factory where He Mu was hiding.

136
00:06:29,870 --> 00:06:30,930
Did they catch him?

137
00:06:31,470 --> 00:06:33,270
They only caught his assistant.

138
00:06:34,909 --> 00:06:36,300
He's quite loyal,

139
00:06:36,630 --> 00:06:39,360
and would rather die
than reveal He Mu's hiding place.

140
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:40,510
Loyal?

141
00:06:40,740 --> 00:06:42,090
He's been with him for so many years,

142
00:06:42,090 --> 00:06:44,150
so he's definitely got blood on his hands.

143
00:06:44,150 --> 00:06:45,830
He knows he'll die even if he tells now,

144
00:06:45,830 --> 00:06:47,630
so he might as well take a gamble.

145
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:50,300
He can run, but he can't hide forever.

146
00:06:57,010 --> 00:06:58,340
This is Wen Xin's phone.

147
00:06:59,430 --> 00:07:01,430
When I took her to rehab this morning,

148
00:07:01,430 --> 00:07:02,680
she gave it to me.

149
00:07:03,510 --> 00:07:05,210
She said she was afraid
He Mu would contact her again,

150
00:07:05,210 --> 00:07:07,140
and she wouldn't be able to resist.

151
00:07:08,120 --> 00:07:11,240
I thought we could take down He Mu today,

152
00:07:11,430 --> 00:07:12,490
but unexpectedly,

153
00:07:12,870 --> 00:07:14,240
he slipped away again.

154
00:07:15,430 --> 00:07:16,560
But I know him.

155
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:18,790
He definitely won't let it go.

156
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:19,870
Now,

157
00:07:19,870 --> 00:07:22,240
Wen Xin is the only card
he has left to play,

158
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:24,000
so he will definitely make a move.

159
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:26,560
He's probably trying to
use her to get to us.

160
00:07:27,270 --> 00:07:28,920
So if he contacts her,

161
00:07:29,610 --> 00:07:31,610
we can trace the call

162
00:07:31,630 --> 00:07:33,140
to lock down his IP.

163
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:40,380
The fish took the bait.

164
00:07:40,890 --> 00:07:43,490
Since Uncle Long are
so desperate to find He Mu,

165
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:44,440
why not

166
00:07:45,750 --> 00:07:47,150
send him the address too.

167
00:07:57,510 --> 00:07:59,360
Wen Xin,

168
00:08:00,070 --> 00:08:01,400
thank goodness for you.

169
00:08:02,390 --> 00:08:03,720
Once you're here,

170
00:08:05,590 --> 00:08:07,030
I can hold you.

171
00:08:08,270 --> 00:08:10,510
Jiang Yu and Wen Jianan

172
00:08:11,390 --> 00:08:13,040
will be drawn here by you.

173
00:08:19,190 --> 00:08:21,310
Right where it all began,

174
00:08:21,820 --> 00:08:23,020
I will end all of this.

175
00:08:24,830 --> 00:08:26,150
How perfect.

176
00:08:43,799 --> 00:08:44,330
Uncle...

177
00:08:45,460 --> 00:08:46,120
Uncle Long,

178
00:08:49,260 --> 00:08:49,800
stop hitting me!

179
00:08:49,800 --> 00:08:50,680
Let me explain!

180
00:08:50,710 --> 00:08:51,590
Let me explain!

181
00:08:51,610 --> 00:08:54,540
The failure to acquire Wen Group
must be an accident.

182
00:08:56,740 --> 00:08:58,150
Jiang Yu and Wen Jianan

183
00:08:58,170 --> 00:08:59,420
must found out something,

184
00:08:59,420 --> 00:09:01,020
so they framed me on purpose.

185
00:09:04,520 --> 00:09:05,760
Two billion.

186
00:09:06,400 --> 00:09:07,950
Half of my life's savings.

187
00:09:08,310 --> 00:09:09,150
He Mu,

188
00:09:09,540 --> 00:09:10,840
you got quite an appetite,

189
00:09:10,840 --> 00:09:12,310
daring to swallow my money!

190
00:09:12,310 --> 00:09:13,120
No.

191
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:15,000
You even used me as a tool

192
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:16,930
to deal with Wen Jianan,

193
00:09:17,870 --> 00:09:19,600
so you could reap the benefits.

194
00:09:19,640 --> 00:09:20,520
No, no, no!

195
00:09:20,540 --> 00:09:22,870
Weren't you quite talkative in the video?

196
00:09:23,770 --> 00:09:24,650
What video?

197
00:09:25,370 --> 00:09:26,630
I don't know anything.

198
00:09:28,330 --> 00:09:29,610
Swiss bank,

199
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:33,070
ending in 6688. It's yours, right?

200
00:09:36,290 --> 00:09:37,910
No, it's not my card number.

201
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:39,920
I don't know anything about a Swiss bank.

202
00:09:39,920 --> 00:09:41,040
I'm being framed.

203
00:09:42,160 --> 00:09:43,220
It must be Jiang Yu.

204
00:09:43,710 --> 00:09:44,630
It must be him.

205
00:09:49,370 --> 00:09:50,680
Still arguing, huh?

206
00:09:51,140 --> 00:09:52,570
They did make a move,

207
00:09:52,590 --> 00:09:54,740
but you've done plenty to cross me too.

208
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:55,870
Finally,

209
00:09:56,520 --> 00:09:58,400
I'll deal with them myself.

210
00:09:59,560 --> 00:10:00,540
Un-uncle Long,

211
00:10:20,150 --> 00:10:21,440
what the hell?

212
00:10:22,030 --> 00:10:23,270
It's still hot.

213
00:10:36,700 --> 00:10:37,900
Do you believe in God?

214
00:10:38,550 --> 00:10:40,280
Your God can't save you either!

215
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:42,080
You broke your word

216
00:10:42,150 --> 00:10:43,120
go to hell!

217
00:11:09,250 --> 00:11:09,890
Longqing,

218
00:11:10,150 --> 00:11:11,690
you are suspected of intentional homicide

219
00:11:11,690 --> 00:11:12,930
and gang violence.

220
00:11:13,100 --> 00:11:14,500
You are now under arrest.

221
00:11:15,070 --> 00:11:16,330
Put down your weapons.

222
00:11:38,280 --> 00:11:40,540
Good and evil will eventually be repaid.

223
00:11:40,950 --> 00:11:42,070
Every sin

224
00:11:42,890 --> 00:11:44,490
will be paid for.

225
00:11:45,360 --> 00:11:47,390
The well-deserved commendation this time

226
00:11:47,390 --> 00:11:50,320
should earn representative Yin
another promotion.

227
00:11:50,410 --> 00:11:52,170
The crisis in Wen Group is over.

228
00:11:52,790 --> 00:11:54,290
The lead perpetrator behind
the malicious takeover

229
00:11:54,290 --> 00:11:55,840
has finally been brought to justice.

230
00:11:55,840 --> 00:11:57,840
The group is back on track.

231
00:12:03,270 --> 00:12:04,030
Everything

232
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:05,670
will start anew.

233
00:12:19,700 --> 00:12:22,280
[Afterward, Jiang Yu and Wen Jianan voluntarily surrendered to the authorities,
confessing to their roles in setting up Wen Yanhui
to invest and resorting to vigilante justice.]

234
00:12:22,310 --> 00:12:24,700
[Given their significant cooperation
in helping the police dismantle a criminal syndicate,
the court ruled as follows:]

235
00:12:24,740 --> 00:12:27,050
[Jiang Yu received a three-year suspended prison sentence.
Wen Jianan was given a warning and ordered to pay civil damages.]

236
00:12:27,880 --> 00:12:31,710
[Wen Xin and Wen Jianan also
voluntarily confessed to unlawfully restricting
Wen Yanhui's personal freedom.]

237
00:12:31,730 --> 00:12:35,170
[For the crime of intentional harm, Wen Xin,
as the principal offender,
was sentenced to six months' controlled supervision.
Wen Jianan, as an accomplice,
received five days' detention and a fine.]
